fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth266parser.html#GstH266ProfileTierLevel","fragment":"\n\tGstH266ProfileTierLevel\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266ProfileTierLevel\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266ProfileTierLevel\n\nMembers\nStructure defining the H266 profile, tier and level.\nthe profile id.\nspecifies the main tier or high tier.\nindicates a level to which OlsInScope conforms\nas specified in Annex A.\nspecifies whether sps_field_seq_flag for all\npictures in OlsInScope shall be equal to 0.\nspecifies whether the CVSs of OlsInScope\nmight contain more than one layer.\nthe GstH266GeneralConstraintsInfo contains\nthe general constraints info.\nspecifies whether level information is present\nin the profile_tier_level syntax structure for the sublayer representation.\nthe sublayer level idc.\nspecifies the number of the general_sub_profile_idc[i]\nsyntax elements.\nspecifies the i-th interoperability indicator registered\nas specified by Rec. ITU-T T.35\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 profile, tier and level.\nthe profile id.\nspecifies the main tier or high tier.\nindicates a level to which OlsInScope conforms\nas specified in Annex A.\nspecifies whether sps_field_seq_flag for all\npictures in OlsInScope shall be equal to 0.\nspecifies whether the CVSs of OlsInScope\nmight contain more than one layer.\nthe GstCodecParsers.H266GeneralConstraintsInfo contains\nthe general constraints info.\nspecifies whether level information is present\nin the profile_tier_level syntax structure for the sublayer representation.\nthe sublayer level idc.\nspecifies the number of the general_sub_profile_idc[i]\nsyntax elements.\nspecifies the i-th interoperability indicator registered\nas specified by Rec. ITU-T T.35\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 profile, tier and level.\nthe profile id.\nspecifies the main tier or high tier.\nindicates a level to which OlsInScope conforms\nas specified in Annex A.\nspecifies whether sps_field_seq_flag for all\npictures in OlsInScope shall be equal to 0.\nspecifies whether the CVSs of OlsInScope\nmight contain more than one layer.\nthe GstCodecParsers.H266GeneralConstraintsInfo contains\nthe general constraints info.\nspecifies whether level information is present\nin the profile_tier_level syntax structure for the sublayer representation.\nthe sublayer level idc.\nspecifies the number of the general_sub_profile_idc[i]\nsyntax elements.\nspecifies the i-th interoperability indicator registered\nas specified by Rec. ITU-T T.35\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});